	<skos:broader rdf:resource="http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L06/current/65"/>
	<skos:definition xml:lang="en">This satellite was the 2nd flight of the HY-2 programme. It operated between October 2018 and is operational until 2026 at an altitude of 973km, in a sunsynchronous orbit. Instrumentation: Laser Retroreflector Array; Microwave Radiometer Imager; HY Scatterometer; Calibration Microwave Radiometer; Radar Altimeter.</skos:definition>
	<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="en">NSOAS/CAST - Hai Yang 2B</skos:hiddenLabel>
