	<skos:broader rdf:resource="http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L06/current/65"/>
	<skos:definition xml:lang="en">This satellite was the 3rd flight of the HY-2 programme. It operated between September 2020 and is operational until 2026 at an altitude of 1336km, in a drifting orbit. Instrumentation: Radar Altimeter; Doppler Orbitography and Radiopositioning Integrated by Satellite; Laser Retroreflector Array; Calibration Microwave Radiometer; HY Scatterometer .</skos:definition>
	<skos:hiddenLabel xml:lang="en">NSOAS/CAST - Hai Yang 2C</skos:hiddenLabel>
